WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Keep items for later
Open Wishlist for the refreshed saved list. Inspect the product, move it
to the basket when ready, or remove the saved entry.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Read the basket summary
Review variants, quantities, seller groups and accepted adjustments.
Recheck the final currency and total.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Complete the four sections
Check Address, Delivery, Payment and Review. Read the terms before
agreeing and submitting once; this tour does not place an order.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Find the purchase record
After a real submission, use Invoices & orders to find the invoice. If a
request timed out, check here before submitting again.

